VALUES ('juniper-qfx5100-48s-6-units', 'ZX-0TFMZN', 'Juniper', 'QFX5100-48S', 'QFX5100-48S-6QSFP', 'DATACENTER', 'Networking', 'Six data center top-of-rack switches from a network refresh. Same EOS version across all units, factory-reset, with a clean config. Powers supplies and fans tested. Sold as one lot.', 'USED_TESTED', 'Tested by the owner''s network team, Oct 2026.', 6, 'Santa Clara, CA, USA', '2026-10-24T16:00:00.000+00:00', 'LOT', '14500', 'USD', 0, 'Each switch boots to the factory image, all 48 SFP+ ports link-tested in pairs, QSFP+ ports verified with loopback. PSUs redundant-tested.', '[{"label":"Ports","value":"48 × 10G SFP+ / 4 × 40G QSFP+"},{"label":"Throughput","value":"1.44 Tbps / 1.08 Bpps"},{"label":"Latency","value":"~2 µs"},{"label":"Software","value":"Junos 20.4R3, factory reset"},{"label":"Power","value":"2 × 650 W AC PSU"}]', '/images/sample-switch.jpg', 'Representative photo — not the actual lot.', 1, 1, 'juniperqfx510048sqfx510048s6qsfpnetworking', '2026-11-12T20:00:52.317+00:00', '2026-11-12T20:00:52.317+00:00');

